stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Queued : analysis job created
    Queued --> PreprocessingImages : worker claims job
    PreprocessingImages --> DetectingCells : preprocessing complete
    DetectingCells --> SegmentingCellPairs : mask inference complete
    SegmentingCellPairs --> CalculatingStatistics : retained cells available
    SegmentingCellPairs --> Completed : no selected statistics
    CalculatingStatistics --> Completed : all selected plugins complete

    Queued --> Cancelling : cancel_progress
    PreprocessingImages --> Cancelling : cancel_progress
    DetectingCells --> Cancelling : cancel_progress
    SegmentingCellPairs --> Cancelling : cancel_progress
    CalculatingStatistics --> Cancelling : cancel_progress
    Cancelling --> Cancelled : cooperative cleanup

    Queued --> Failed : stale queued job
    PreprocessingImages --> Failed : internal error
    DetectingCells --> Failed : internal error
    SegmentingCellPairs --> Failed : internal error
    CalculatingStatistics --> Failed : internal error

    note right of Queued
      status = queued
      phase = Queued
    end note

    note right of Completed
      status = succeeded
      phase = Completed
    end note

    note right of Cancelling
      status = cancelling
      cancellation is checked at safe boundaries
    end note

    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
